        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: NRG Energy, Raymond James Financial\n- Places: West Windsor Township, New Jersey; Houston, Texas; NRG Park\n- Concepts: Energy companies, financial services, holding companies\n\nFacts:\n- NRG Energy, Inc. is a large American energy company.\n- NRG Energy, Inc. is dual-headquartered in West Windsor Township, New Jersey, and Houston, Texas.\n- Raymond James Financial is an American diversified holding company.\n- Raymond James Financial provides financial services to individuals, corporations, and municipalities through subsidiary companies.\n- Raymond James Financial’s subsidiaries engage primarily in investment and financial planning, as well as investment banking and asset management.\n- NRG Park is a complex in Houston, Texas, USA.\n- NRG Park was formerly known as Reliant Park and Astrodomain.\n- NRG Park is named after the energy company NRG Energy.",
